16 (a)(1) Every beverage container sold or offered for sale at retail in this
17 State shall clearly indicate by embossing or on the normal product label,
18 imprinting on the normal product label, or in the case of a metal beverage
19 container on the top of the container, other approved method secured to the
20 container the word “Vermont” or the letters “VT” and the refund value of the

