3 (2) The label shall be on the top lid of the beverage container, the side
4 of the beverage container, or in a clearly visible location on the beverage
5 container. This subsection does not prohibit including names or abbreviations
6 of other states with deposit legislation comparable to this chapter.
7 (b) The Commissioner of Liquor and Lottery may allow, in the case of
8 liquor bottles, a conspicuous, adhesive sticker to be attached to indicate the
